{"content_hash": "40cdb18ef18ec2ee", "version_id": 615, "article_id": 62, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Guardians blank White Sox as Williams fans 12 to seal ALDS comeback", "title_zh": "守护者零封白袜，威廉姆斯12次三振锁定美联分区赛逆转", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/10/cleveland-guardians-chicago-white-sox-alds-game-five-gavin-williams", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1780476871585-eb2a20b32d12?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8d2lsbGlhbXMlMjBzdHJpa2VzJTIwb3V0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjU5NzV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Diego Corona on Unsplash", "author": "Diego Corona", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cldiego?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/mma-fighters-grapple-and-punch-inside-a-fenced-fighting-cage-3Hw-Pc1Oovk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(306, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(344, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "9eb22a7a824f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 271, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Cleveland overturned a two-game deficit to reach the ALCS, with Gavin Williams striking out 12 in a 2-0 Game 5 win over Chicago.", "lead_zh": "克利夫兰在0比2落后的情况下连扳三场，加文·威廉姆斯在第五场生死战中投出12次三振，帮助球队2比0击败芝加哥，晋级美联冠军赛。", "preview": "Gavin Williams struck out 12 and José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox", "preview_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯将一颗略高于本垒板的球轰出全垒打，克利夫兰守护者队在周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中从0比2落后完成逆转。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 603, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/62/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 104.162, "size_bytes": 628704, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@4cb6f94/content/data/versions/615.json", "paragraphs": ["Gavin Williams struck out 12 and José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night, completing a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016.", "Guardians pitchers combined for 21 strikeouts, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to record the final out of one game and start the next when his team faced elimination in both.", "He did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s postseason record, and his 24 over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five series.", "Hunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field. Chicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005."], "paragraphs_zh": ["加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯将一颗略高于本垒板的球轰出全垒打，克利夫兰守护者队在周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中从0比2落后完成逆转。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛。", "守护者队投手群合计投出21次三振，创下九局季后赛的最多纪录。白袜队仅击出三支安打，只有九个球被打入场内，整个系列赛被三振75次。在第四场拿下救援成功两天后，威廉姆斯成为季后赛历史上第三位在球队面临淘汰的连续两场比赛中，先拿下最后出局数、再担任下一场先发的投手。", "直到第六局两人出局时，凯尔·蒂尔才将一颗蝴蝶曲球轻巧地击入右外野，威廉姆斯才被击出第一支安打。此前两局，拉米雷斯连续第二场开轰，从肖恩·伯克手中击出两分全垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基接替威廉姆斯，三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰的季后赛纪录，他在三场比赛中投出的24次三振并列五场系列赛历史第二多。", "亨特·加迪斯接替萨布罗夫斯基，拿下四个出局数。凯德·史密斯收尾，完成职业生涯首次五出局救援，在第九局连续三振三名打者。他用一记快速球让特里斯坦·彼得斯挥棒落空，拿下最后一个出局数，点燃了进步球场的庆祝。芝加哥是首支在连续三个百败赛季后打进季后赛的球队，但自2005年以来再未赢得世界大赛。"], "body": "Gavin Williams struck out 12 and José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night, completing a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016.\n\nGuardians pitchers combined for 21 strikeouts, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to record the final out of one game and start the next when his team faced elimination in both.\n\nHe did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s postseason record, and his 24 over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five series.\n\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field. Chicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.", "body_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯将一颗略高于本垒板的球轰出全垒打，克利夫兰守护者队在周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中从0比2落后完成逆转。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛。\n\n守护者队投手群合计投出21次三振，创下九局季后赛的最多纪录。白袜队仅击出三支安打，只有九个球被打入场内，整个系列赛被三振75次。在第四场拿下救援成功两天后，威廉姆斯成为季后赛历史上第三位在球队面临淘汰的连续两场比赛中，先拿下最后出局数、再担任下一场先发的投手。\n\n直到第六局两人出局时，凯尔·蒂尔才将一颗蝴蝶曲球轻巧地击入右外野，威廉姆斯才被击出第一支安打。此前两局，拉米雷斯连续第二场开轰，从肖恩·伯克手中击出两分全垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基接替威廉姆斯，三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰的季后赛纪录，他在三场比赛中投出的24次三振并列五场系列赛历史第二多。\n\n亨特·加迪斯接替萨布罗夫斯基，拿下四个出局数。凯德·史密斯收尾，完成职业生涯首次五出局救援，在第九局连续三振三名打者。他用一记快速球让特里斯坦·彼得斯挥棒落空，拿下最后一个出局数，点燃了进步球场的庆祝。芝加哥是首支在连续三个百败赛季后打进季后赛的球队，但自2005年以来再未赢得世界大赛。", "text": "Gavin Williams struck out 12 and José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night, completing a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. Guardians pitchers combined for 21 strikeouts, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to record the final out of one game and start the next when his team faced elimination in both. He did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s postseason record, and his 24 over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five series. Hunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field. Chicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.", "vocab": [{"word": "strike out", "pos": "verb", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "棒球术语，指投手使打者三击不中出局。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "blank", "pos": "verb", "zh": "零封", "note": "体育报道中表示使对手一分未得。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "comeback", "pos": "noun", "zh": "逆转", "note": "指落后后反败为胜。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deficit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "落后分数", "note": "常与 overcome、complete 搭配。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "best-of-five", "pos": "adj", "zh": "五场三胜制", "note": "系列赛赛制，先赢三场者晋级。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "postseason", "pos": "noun", "zh": "季后赛", "note": "常规赛之后进行的淘汰赛阶段。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save", "pos": "noun", "zh": "救援成功", "note": "投手在特定情况下保住领先优势。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "elimination", "pos": "noun", "zh": "淘汰", "note": "指球队面临被淘汰出局的危险。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "relieve", "pos": "verb", "zh": "接替投球", "note": "指后援投手替换场上投手。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tie", "pos": "verb", "zh": "追平", "note": "指成绩与纪录持平。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strikeout", "pos": "noun", "zh": "三振", "note": "投手使打者出局的一种方式。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "blow a fastball by", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "用快速球三振", "note": "棒球口语，指用快速球让打者挥空。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "set off", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "引发", "note": "常与 celebration 等词搭配。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drought", "pos": "noun", "zh": "长期未夺冠", "note": "指球队很长时间没有赢得冠军。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback", "summary_original": "Williams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among MLB teams.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback\nWilliams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the\nCleveland Guardians\nbeat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among\nMLB\nteams.\nGuardians pitchers struck out 21, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series.\nTwo days after getting the save in Game 4, Williams became just the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and start the following game when his team faced elimination in both.\nHe did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke.\nAfter a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami.\nWilliams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s record for a postseason game. He got 22 swings and misses, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.\nChicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.\nExplore more on these topics\nMLB\nCleveland Guardians\nChicago White Sox\nBaseball\nUS sports\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:46:14.061014", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Gavin", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.5, "sm": 100, "em": 500, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Williams", "s": 0.512, "e": 0.962, "sm": 512, "em": 962, "cs": 6, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "struck", "s": 0.975, "e": 1.262, "sm": 975, "em": 1262, "cs": 15, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "out", "s": 1.275, "e": 1.475, "sm": 1275, "em": 1474, "cs": 22, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "12", "s": 1.488, "e": 1.875, "sm": 1487, "em": 1875, "cs": 26, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "and", "s": 1.887, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1887, "em": 1950, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Jos", "s": 1.962, "e": 2.272, "sm": 1962, "em": 2271, "cs": 33, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "é", "s": 2.272, "e": 2.375, "sm": 2271, "em": 2375, "cs": 36, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Ram", "s": 2.388, "e": 2.591, "sm": 2387, "em": 2591, "cs": 38, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "í", "s": 2.591, "e": 2.659, "sm": 2591, "em": 2658, "cs": 41, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "rez", "s": 2.659, "e": 2.863, "sm": 2658, "em": 2862, "cs": 42, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "homered", "s": 2.875, "e": 3.263, "sm": 2875, "em": 3262, "cs": 46, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "on", "s": 3.275, "e": 3.4, "sm": 3275, "em": 3400, "